    "title": "📅 Live Music with Jimmy Duhig at The Fink on March 18 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 days ago Local musician Jimmy Duhig , a fifth-generation Napa Valley native, will perform live at The Fink on Monday, March 18 , from 6:00 to 8:00 p.m. Jimmy’s set will feature a mix of Hawaiian Slack-Key, Latin, and classic rock tunes, all played on his ukulele. There’s no cover fee , so you can just drop in, enjoy the music, and sip one of The Fink’s signature cocktails.\n📍 The Fink , Downtown Napa\n📞 (707) 257-0322\nMore details: thefinknapa.com\nMore Info: The Fink Presents: JIMMY DUHIG - Downtown Napa Eve...",
